<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS8" title="In 4. Algorithm and Numerical experiments ‣ Provable orbit recovery over SO(3) from the non-uniform second moment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.8 </span>Robustness to distribution nonuniformity</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS8.SSS1" title="In 4.8. Robustness to distribution nonuniformity ‣ 4. Algorithm and Numerical experiments ‣ Provable orbit recovery over SO(3) from the non-uniform second moment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.8.1 </span>Robustness to distribution’s angular coverage</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS8.SSS2" title="In 4.8. Robustness to distribution nonuniformity ‣ 4. Algorithm and Numerical experiments ‣ Provable orbit recovery over SO(3) from the non-uniform second moment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.8.2 </span>Robustness to distribution’s variance</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Provable orbit recovery over SO(3) from the non-uniform second moment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>The path to provable algorithms for cryo-EM?</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Provable orbit recovery over SO(3) from the non-uniform second moment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
